  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components and autoclave under a N2-CO2 (80:20, v/v) gas atmosphere. After cooling, add the following solutions from anaerobic stocks (autoclaved or filter-sterilized):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Aseptically and anaerobically distribute the medium into culture vessels under a H2-CO2 (80:20, v/v) gas stream and seal with butyl stoppers. Prior to inoculation, add per liter the following solutions (autoclaved and stored under a N2 atmosphere):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "Readjust pH to 7.5, if necessary. Pressurize inoculated culture vessels to 100 kPa H2-CO2 (80:20, v/v)."
    }
  ]
}